Added `toFahrenheit` to `src/temperature.js`, mirroring `toCelsius`'s style:

```js
/** Celsius -> Fahrenheit, rounded to one decimal. */
export function toFahrenheit(c) {
  return Math.round(((c * 9) / 5 + 32) * 10) / 10;
}
```

The one-decimal rounding is what makes the round-trip test pass — `toCelsius(98.6)` returns `37`, and without rounding `toFahrenheit(37)` would give `98.60000000000001`.

